  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Occ 101.01 Purpose. This chapter sets forth the organization and statutory responsibilities of the occupational therapy governing board and the manner of communication with the board.\n\nSource. #8572, eff 1-26-05; ss by #13081, eff 7-31-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Occ 100); ss by #14366, eff 9-9-25",
